<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>He’s a Friend so true, so patient and so kind,</l><l>He’s a wonderful Savior to me;</l><l>Everything I need in Him I always find,</l><l>He’s a wonderful Savior to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>He is always near to comfort and to cheer,</l><l>He’s a wonderful Savior to me;</l><l>He forgives my sins, He dries my every tear,</l><l>He’s a wonderful Savior to me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Dearer grows the love of Jesus day by day,</l><l>He’s a wonderful Savior to me;</l><l>Sweeter is His grace while pressing on my way,</l><l>He’s a wonderful Savior to me.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
